SM-T715 tablet: the phone's modem pieces, on shannond's ModemManager facade.

Puts the mobile data tile back (the SS333 modem now works) and drives it
through NetworkManager's gsm connection, since omamobile-sit is the Pixel's
modem daemon: tile-state.sh probes nmcli, tile-action.sh brings the
connection up or down. Since upstream 0.2.94 the tile draws signal bars
(TilesModel.dataIcon) from tile-state.sh's data_signal, so the probe now
reads the signal percent and the technology from shannond's status too.
Against omarchy-mobile 87b8395 (omamobile-shell 0.2.94),
packages/omamobile-shell, on top of patches 0001 to 0003 (applied with
patch -p1 in that directory; renumbered from 0005).

